<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 105,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 105,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's est 105,000, Wk ago 102,000, and Yr ago 98,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher than the mid-session Monday. Trade was moderate for good demand and moderate offerings. Top 49.00 per cwt.</p>
